      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kent%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1832, Major John Dement defeated Black Hawk’s warriors at Kellogg’s Grove, the last major battle in Illinois; a monument was erected in 1886.",
